Package: vabaxos-sounds
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: sound-theme-freedesktop, gsettings-desktop-schemas
Recommends: gnome-session-canberra
Description: VabaxOS system sounds
 The VabaxOS sound theme, with the timbre of Ubuntu's sounds and melodies
 of its own, and three more: Cristallo (bells), Morbido (soft
 mallets) and Aria (gentle pads). They share the motif of the boot menu
 beeps: rising when something starts or arrives, falling when it ends or
 leaves, so events can be told apart without seeing the screen. Sounds
 the themes do not have come from the freedesktop theme.
